# Consolidates the many machine-local git identities the team accumulated at 42 (one
# per workstation) into one entry per person, so `git shortlog -sn` and GitHub's
# contributor view show the real distribution. trindran alone had committed from 17
# different machines, which made 61 commits look like 10.
#
# Confirmed by the team: ckeven = cramaros, Sesedra = srabeman.
# Not mapped: Pendragon46 <160462125+Pendragon46@users.noreply.github.com> — identity
# unconfirmed, and guessing would misattribute someone's work.

